        "notes": "House of Lies features intense violence, blood, gore, and mature themes. Players will be required to shoot and kill zombies, as well as other human characters. The game also includes graphic depictions of blood and gore, including dismemberment and decapitation.\r\n\r\nIn addition, House of Lies includes mature themes and content related to illegal drug activities. This includes depictions of drug use, as well as references to human experimentation and other disturbing content.\r\n\r\nPlease be aware that this game is not suitable for all audiences and is intended for mature players only. Player discretion is advised."
